			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@brawaru\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>brawaru</span></a></span> I get it but it’s failing on pretty basic JS patterns so far. If I change the Array type to object, it passes without error.</p>",
