			"author": {
				"name": "Paul Everitt",
				"url": "https://fosstodon.org/@pauleveritt",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/432/874/090/408/447/original/7ad02e12d7b76361.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-26T22:52:58.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Here's a repo. If you'd like, I can make a quick video walkthrough if that's more efficient. <a href=\"https://github.com/pauleveritt/eleventy-test-config\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/pauleveritt/elevent</span><span class=\"invisible\">y-test-config</span></a></p>",
